<!-- What Is a Qi2 Magnetic Wireless Car Charger Mount -->
<section id="what-is-a-qi2-magnetic-wireless-car-charger-mount" class="sec bg-white relative" data-section="content">
 <div class="container-wide">
 <h2 class="section-title text-center">What Is a Qi2 Magnetic Wireless Car Charger Mount?</h2>
 <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">A Qi2 magnetic car charger mount combines a <strong>phone holder and wireless fast charger</strong> into one automotive accessory. Built around the Qi2 MPP (Magnetic Power Profile) standard with <strong>N52H neodymium magnets</strong>, modern car mounts deliver 15W-25W wireless charging with perfect magnetic snap alignment — eliminating the need to fumble with cables while driving. For B2B buyers, the wireless car charger mount aftermarket is the <strong>fastest-growing segment in automotive charging</strong> — 50% of new cars now ship with wireless charging built in, but over 1 billion vehicles on the road today do not, creating a massive retrofit opportunity.</p>

 <blockquote class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 bg-brandOrange/5 border-l-4 border-brandOrange rounded-r-xl px-6 py-5 text-sm text-slate-700 italic leading-relaxed">
  <p>"The global wireless car charging stand market was valued at approximately $181 million in 2025 and is projected to reach $296 million by 2032, growing at a 7.5% CAGR. The broader vehicle-mounted wireless charger market — including OEM-integrated and aftermarket mounts — reached $1.47 billion in 2025, with magnetic alignment (Qi2) and active cooling emerging as the two defining technology trends. Aftermarket sales account for 71.8% of automotive mobile accessory purchases, driven by smartphone upgrade cycles and expanding hands-free driving legislation."</p>
  <cite class="block text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 not-italic">— <a href="https://www.marketresearch.com/LP-Information-Inc-v4134/Global-Vehicle-mounted-Wireless-Charger-44850256/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline">LP Information</a>, Global Vehicle-Mounted Wireless Charger Market 2026-2032; <a href="https://www.factmr.com/report/6/automotive-mobile-accessories-market" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline">Fact.MR</a>, Automotive Mobile Accessories Market 2025-2036</cite>
